  m_text: '* everything is in default setting *


    RMB (Right mouse button) -
    charge up kick

    LMB (left mouse button) - charge up dribble

    RMB and
    lmb - bicycle kick

    FLICKING MOUSE SIDEways - curving left or right

    flicking
    mouse up or down - adding top or down spin

    WASD - movement

    SPace bar
    - jump

    left control - slide

    e - dash

    c - perform left ability

    v
    - perform right ability

    q - player gk dive

    t - player gk catch (cannot
    catch teammate passes)

    r - respawn ball'
