--- !u!114 &1792226577
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1792226575}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<U><size=15>V1.0.3.2 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Added LAN multiplayer.\n\n*
    clients can no longer see the session id or ip address.\n\n* you can no longer
    trap when the ball is out of bounds.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.3.1 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>*
    Max stamina 200 -> 250\n\n* Spin shot multiplier 1.35 -> 1.37\n\n* Non-spin shot
    multiplier 0.85 -> 0.9\n\n* Increased bicycle kick hitbox.\n\n* bicycle kicks
    can now also be performed on the ground.\n\n* improved player gk's catch hitbox.\n\n*
    made player gk deflection logic server-sided.\n\n* Made AI goalkicks faster and
    lower.\n\n* revamped the ai goalkeeper's saving logic.\n\n* added a ui pop-up
    message for player gk's when they\ntry to catch their own teammate's passes.\n\n*
    Added jersey customization.\n\n* Added the ability to spin player in the lobby.\n\n*
    added UI indicators for high latency and server desync.\n\n* made the roulette
    ability server-sided.\n\n* fixed the ball becoming permanently stuck when a player\nswitches
    to the GK position while the AI has the ball.\n\n* you now cannot change positions
    while the ball is out of \nbounds.\n\n* fixed in-game stats (goals, assists,
    and saves) not resetting\nback to 0 after the game ends.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.3.0
    patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* added player customization! \n\n* you can now personalize
    your character's hair, accessories,\nsoccer ball models, and trails!\n\n* Note:
    the shop and emote customization will come later.\n\n* added two new ways to
    spawn the ball in the practice server.\npress 1 - low pass | 2 - high pass.\n\n*
    this should allow you to practice tap-ins, headers, and bicycle\nkicks!\n\n*
    added bicycle kick (hold down rmb and lmb together\nand must be on the air).\n\n*
    added a mouse dpi setting making curve shots easier as\nintended.\n\n* added
    the host's rank and username in the lobby session\nlist.\n\n* fixed sessions
    not deleting quickly when the host alt + f4s.\n\n* fixed the inner dot setting
    toggle not updating.\n\n* fixed being able to adjust the xp bar.\n\n* fixed the
    text display at the end of the game to properly show\nwhether or not you won,
    lost, or drew. \n\n* fixed global emote audio source not working.\n\n* fixed
    being able to trap the ball when the ball was out of\nbounds.\n\n* (Not sure)
    fixed the mic UI not appearing at the top of player's heads even when\nthey are
    speaking.\n\n* (Not sure) fixed making the player getting stuck \nforever after
    performing the kickability.\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.2.4 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>*
    Fixed usernames not updating properly.\n\n* fixed a bug where your cursor would
    dissapear completely\nwhen you press esc in the player selection ui.\n\n* reworked
    the server-arbitration logic.\n\n* Made it so that the \"Kill\" ability cannot
    affect player goalkeepers.\n\r\n* Added the ability for hosts to kick players.\n\r\n*
    Fixed player stats not updating.\n\r\n* Attempted to fix Steam cloud save.\n\r\n*
    Fixed some UIs not positioning correctly on some resolutions.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.2.3
    patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Added proximity chat. \nyou can now talk to your
    friend in real time!\ngo to the settings to change your proximity settings.\n\n*
    fixed roulette being stuck for clients.\n\n* fixed the ball being permanently
    stuck when switching \nto a gk position.\n\n* made the jump section in the tutorial
    easier.\n\n* made the trap section in the tutorial easier.\n\n* fixed rebinds
    not working.\n\n* fixed being able to score even when the ball was out of bounds.\n\n*
    reworked the server-side arbitration system (should now favor\nlower ping).\n\n*
    your player stats (goals, assists, and saves) now save even\nwhen there's less
    than 3 players.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.2.2 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Added
    language support for the following:\n\n* chinese (simplified).\n\n* korean (hangul).\n\n*
    Japanese (hiragana, katakana, kanji).\n\n* go to the discord server if there
    is an language not supported\nhere!\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.2.1 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>*
    Nerfed the kick power of powerkick.\n\n* increased cooldown of powerkick (10s
    -> 35s).\n\n* increased cooldown of kill (30s -> 45s).\n\n* Slightly increased
    shooting/dribbling hitbox.\n\n* Fixed ball not syncing when caught by a player
    gk.\n\n* now all servers display regions they are located in.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.2.0
    patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Added the option to enable/disable ai goalkeepers
    in practice.\n\n* added the ability to spawn defense dummies.\n\n* added the
    ability to despawn defense dummies.\n\n* reduced the tick rate from 128 to 30
    (should hopefully improve\nnetworking!)\n\n* reduced the jump power.\n\n* fixed
    gravity.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.1.1 patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Fixed resolutions
    not changing.\n\n* Fixed cloud sync messing resolutions from different monitors.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.1.0
    patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Fixed player goalkeepers unable to pick up the ball.\n\n*
    fixed camera distance and ball data not initializing properly.\n\n* Added a reset
    all settings button.\n\n* Implemented cloud saving for Steam.\n\n\n<U><size=15>V1.0.0.0
    patch notes:</U>\n<size=10>* Released v1.0.0.0 to the public!\n\n* Check the
    steam page for more information."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a80dca6a382c0f64bb04d153be203890, type: 2}
